@startuml
title 外卖点餐与配送系统 时序图
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #555555
    FontColor #222222
}
skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #555555
    FontColor #222222
}
actor 顾客 as Customer
participant "顾客端" as App
participant "订单服务" as OrderSvc
participant "库存服务" as InvSvc
participant "支付服务" as PaySvc
participant "支付网关" as Gateway
participant "商家端" as MerchantApp
participant "配送调度服务" as DeliverySvc
participant "配送员端" as CourierApp
participant "通知服务" as Notify
== 阶段一：提交订单与库存检查 ==
Customer -> App : 选择菜品并提交订单
App -> OrderSvc : submit(cart, address, deliveryType)
OrderSvc -> OrderSvc : 校验营业状态/菜品状态\n检查重复下单
OrderSvc -> InvSvc : lock(orderItems)
alt 库存不足或菜品售罄
    InvSvc --> OrderSvc : 锁定失败
    OrderSvc --> App : 返回缺货/售罄提示
    App --> Customer : 提示调整购物车
else 锁定成功
    InvSvc --> OrderSvc : 锁定成功
    OrderSvc -> OrderSvc : 按店铺拆单并计算价格
    OrderSvc --> App : 订单号 + 待支付金额
end
== 阶段二：支付与库存反馈 ==
Customer -> App : 选择支付方式并支付
App -> PaySvc : pay(orderId, channel)
PaySvc -> Gateway : 发起支付
alt 支付成功
    Gateway --> PaySvc : 支付成功回调
    PaySvc -> PaySvc : 幂等校验并记录支付
    PaySvc -> InvSvc : deduct(orderItems)
    PaySvc -> OrderSvc : markPaid(orderId)
    OrderSvc -> Notify : 推送新订单事件
    Notify -> MerchantApp : 新订单提醒
else 支付失败
    Gateway --> PaySvc : 支付失败
    PaySvc --> App : 提示重新支付
    App --> Customer : 展示重试入口
else 支付超时
    PaySvc -> OrderSvc : 取消订单
    OrderSvc -> InvSvc : release(orderItems)
    OrderSvc -> Notify : 通知顾客订单取消
end
== 阶段三：商家接单与配送 ==
alt 商家拒单
    MerchantApp -> OrderSvc : reject(orderId, reason)
    OrderSvc -> PaySvc : refund(order)
    PaySvc -> Gateway : 原路退款
    OrderSvc -> InvSvc : scheduleRestore(orderItems)
    OrderSvc -> Notify : 通知顾客并关闭订单
else 接单成功
    MerchantApp -> OrderSvc : accept(orderId)
    OrderSvc -> DeliverySvc : createTask(order)
    DeliverySvc -> Notify : 发布到订单大厅
    Notify -> CourierApp : 抢单提醒
    CourierApp -> DeliverySvc : grabTask(taskId)
    DeliverySvc -> DeliverySvc : 校验最大接单数
    DeliverySvc --> CourierApp : 抢单成功
    CourierApp -> DeliverySvc : confirmDelivered(image)
    DeliverySvc -> OrderSvc : markDelivered(orderId)
    OrderSvc -> Notify : 通知顾客确认收货
    Customer -> App : 确认收货
    App -> OrderSvc : confirmReceipt(orderId)
    OrderSvc -> OrderSvc : 状态机校验并完成订单
    OrderSvc -> Notify : 订单完成事件
end
@enduml